            "content": "<p><strong>These gummies are shockingly delicious, like strawberries!</strong><br/><br/>I hate subscriptions because I feel like they are a trap so I canceled it before the gummies even arrived. We quickly decided to resubscribe because we love Grüns so much! A bonus is my kids love them too!</p>",
